From d15d1ade804111a527efdff1c20a2140ea3b7621 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scroll Ash Lab <scrollash.lab@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 17:10:20 -1000
Subject: [PATCH] ink_detection: report depth order and in-plane scale
 (villa#1648)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Log effective depth_order and in_plane_scale_um during flat inference.
Depth orientation is segment/render-dependent: emit an INFO note to try
--direction both when undeclared; do not prescribe reverse. WARN only when
in-plane scale is much finer than the ~9.6 µm aligned training grid.
Default --direction remains forward.
---
